obtained is unverified, and so is whether it permits web embedding and public
redistribution. The font is not covered by the AGPL.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. Song transcriptions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The built-in pattern library contains traditional tunes (Twinkle Twinkle, Mary
Had a Little Lamb, Hot Cross Buns, Ode to Joy) and short phrases that appear
to be written for the app (their authorship is not recorded in the repository).
Third-party song transcriptions were removed from it (BJS-478); they remain in
git history, which was not rewritten. Anything a player records or imports is
the player's own data.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
8. Worklet-engine room impulse recipe (Apache-2.0)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/audio/effects.ts adapts the reverb impulse recipe from superdough's
reverbGen.mjs, Copyright 2014 Alan deLespinasse, Apache License 2.0.
The adaptation uses promises and local native nodes and removes debug state.
See licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. EmotiTone's overall licence remains AGPL-3.0-or-later.
